{
  "entry": "net.glxn.qrgen.javase.QRCode#file()Ljava/io/File;",
  "observer": "The ordinary Java SE caller returns an ImageIO-readable QR file whose decoded text is the original ASCII input.",
  "domainBasis": "The submitted text is its own independent round-trip expectation. Each image is read through Java ImageIO and decoded with its corresponding ZXing runtime. The historical test only asserted that the returned file was non-null.",
